{"symbol":"RUDRAGAS","yahoo":"RUDRAGAS.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"name":"Rudra Gas Enterprise Limited","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Engineering & Construction","website":"https://www.rudragasenterprise.com","about":"Rudra Gas Enterprise Limited engages in the provision of end-to-end solutions for city gas distribution sector in India. The company is involved in gas distribution network projects, such as PNG domestic connection; commercial natural gas connection; industrial natural gas connection; operation and maintenance of gas pipeline network; fiber cable network project, including liaison of right to use (RoU) and right to work (RoW) permission; high density polyethylene duct laying; manhole installations; fibre cable blowing; splicing; optical time domain reflector; light source and power meter ; operation and maintenance of fiber networks; and mobile/wifi tower erection. It also engages in renting of construction machinery and vehicles verticals; setting up of infrastructure facilities; provides technical services; and tower installations, network expansion, and maintenance related to telecom sector. Rudra Gas Enterprise Limited was incorporated in 2012 and is based in Ahmedabad, India.","updated":"2026-09-26T06:53:52+00:00","quote":{"price":72.1,"prevClose":72.1,"marketCap":60.12,"high52":103.03,"low52":55.6,"pe":6.97,"bookValue":49.01,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":23.43,"shares":0.8338,"insiders":73.19,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2024-02-15","2024-02-16","2024-02-19","2024-02-20","2024-02-21","2024-02-22","2024-02-23","2024-02-26","2024-02-27","2024-02-28","2024-02-29","2024-03-01","2024-03-04","2024-03-05","2024-03-06","2024-03-07","2024-03-11","2024-03-12","2024-03-13","2024-03-14","2024-03-18","2024-03-19","2024-03-20","2024-03-21","2024-03-22","2024-03-26","2024-03-27","2024-03-28","2024-04-01","2024-04-02","2024-04-03","2024-04-04","2024-04-05","2024-04-08","2024-04-09","2024-04-10","2024-04-12","2024-04-15","2024-04-16","2024-04-18","2024